  m_Name: The True Memory
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ItemData
  displayName: The True Memory
  description: No armory and no Abe. A wet evening on the hill road above Lowmere,
    bread under her coat, her grandmother's rain song in her mouth. The Storm came
    down because it needed somewhere to hide, and she was the only one out walking.
    It was a small life. It was hers.
